Question 3
Write an R program to accept a positive integer n and, using a for loop:

a. Generate the first n terms of the Fibonacci series.
b. Calculate the sum of the generated terms.
c. Display the largest term in the series.

Code:
n <- as.integer(readline("Enter number of terms: "))

a <- 0
b <- 1
sum <- 0
largest <- 0

for (i in 1:n) {
  print(a)
  sum <- sum + a
  largest <- a

  temp <- a + b
  a <- b
  b <- temp
}

print(paste("Sum =", sum))
print(paste("Largest term =", largest))

