Question 4
Write an R program using a repeat loop to continuously accept numbers from the user. The program should terminate when the user enters 0. After termination, display the sum of all the numbers entered and the total number of values entered (excluding 0).

Code:
sum <- 0
count <- 0

repeat {
  n <- as.numeric(readline("Enter a number (0 to stop): "))

  if (n == 0)
    break

  sum <- sum + n
  count <- count + 1
}

print(paste("Sum =", sum))
print(paste("Total numbers =", count))

